<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Portfolio</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Inter:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --blue:   #001e46;
    --red:    #e30613;
    --yellow: #ffcc00;
    --white:  #ffffff;
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 80% -10%, rgba(227,6,19,.25), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(900px 500px at 10% 110%, rgba(255,204,0,.12), transparent 60%),
      var(--blue);
    color: var(--white);
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-bottom: 110px;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  .stripes {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: .18;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(115deg,
      transparent 0 90px, var(--red) 90px 96px,
      transparent 96px 200px, var(--yellow) 200px 204px,
      transparent 204px 340px);
  }

  .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 16px 0; }

  h1, h2, .nav, .badge, .btn { font-family: 'Anton', 'Arial Black', Impact, sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 64px); line-height: .95; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  h1 .red { color: var(--red); }
  h1 .yellow { color: var(--yellow); }
  h2 { font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .label {
    display: inline-block; font-family: 'Anton'; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px;
    background: var(--yellow); color: #111; padding: 4px 12px; transform: skewX(-12deg);
  }

  .card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
    border-radius: 22px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .card-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 22px 22px 14px; }
  .avatar {
    width: 74px; height: 74px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: conic-gradient(from 200deg, var(--red), var(--yellow), var(--red));
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Anton'; font-size: 28px; color: var(--blue);
    border: 3px solid var(--white);
  }
  .handle { font-family: 'Anton'; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .sub { color: #9db4d8; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 2px; }
  .icons { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 16px; color: #9db4d8; }
  .icons span { cursor: pointer; transition: .15s; font-size: 18px; }
  .icons span:hover { color: var(--yellow); transform: translateY(-2px); }

  .pinned { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 22px 22px; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .pinned { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .post-img {
    border-radius: 14px; min-height: 180px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(0,20,60,.25), rgba(0,20,60,.25)),
      repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, var(--red) 0 26px, #b8050f 26px 52px);
    display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  }
  .post-img .tag { font-family: 'Anton'; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; background: var(--white); color: var(--blue); padding: 3px 10px; transform: skewX(-12deg); }
  .pinned-text h2 { font-size: 26px; }
  .pinned-text p { color: #c9d8ef; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .mini-post {
    margin-top: 14px; border-radius: 14px; height: 90px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.15), rgba(0,0,0,.15)),
      repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, var(--yellow) 0 22px, #e6b800 22px 44px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Anton'; color: var(--blue); letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .panel { display: none; padding: 26px 22px; }
  .panel.active { display: block; animation: pop .25s ease-out; }
  @keyframes pop { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px);} to { opacity: 1; transform: none;} }

  .fact {
    display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    border-left: 5px solid var(--red);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .fact:nth-child(2n) { border-left-color: var(--yellow); }
  .fact .num { font-family: 'Anton'; font-size: 26px; color: var(--yellow); min-width: 34px; }
  .fact p { font-size: 15px; color: #dbe6f7; }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px;
    background: var(--red); color: var(--white);
    padding: 12px 26px; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px;
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 65%, 94% 100%, 0 100%);
    text-decoration: none; transition: .15s;
  }
  .btn:hover { background: var(--yellow); color: var(--blue); }

  .badge-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 14px; }
  .badge { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 6px 14px; border: 2px solid var(--white); transform: skewX(-12deg); }
  .badge.hot { background: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); }

  nav {
    position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 18px; transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 10; display: flex; gap: 4px;
    background: #0a0a12; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    border-radius: 14px; padding: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
    max-width: 94vw; overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .nav {
    background: none; border: none; color: #8f9bb3;
    font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 10px 18px;
    cursor: pointer; border-radius: 10px; white-space: nowrap; transition: .15s;
  }
  .nav.active { background: var(--white); color: #0a0a12; }
  .nav:hover { color: var(--yellow); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="stripes"></div>

<div class="wrap">
  <span class="label">Give Me Wings</span>
  <h1>Hey, I'm <span class="red">S</span>hevanti<span class="yellow">.</span><br>Class 10 // Coder in Training</h1>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-head">
      <div class="avatar">S</div>
      <div>
        <div class="handle">hammertime</div>
        <div class="sub">@class10_dev · 14 yrs old · tennis + videogames + books</div>
      </div>
      <div class="icons"><span>≡</span><span>🔗</span><span>▤</span><span>⌂</span><span>✉</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="pinned">
      <div class="post-img">
        <img src="image.png" alt="Pinned Post Image" style="width:100%;border-radius:14px;">
        <span class="tag">PINNED POST</span></div>
      <div class="pinned-text">
        <h2>Fuel for the grind</h2>
        <p>Self-taught coder since age 12. I build small web projects, play lawn tennis, and speedrun my homework. Follow the journey.</p>
        <div class="mini-post">⚡ NO LIMITS</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="panel active" id="p-post">
      <h2>⚡ Three Things About Me</h2>
      <div class="fact"><div class="num">01</div><p>I play lawn tennis and videogames.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="num">02</div><p>I love to read books and watch movies.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="num">03</div><p>Started coding about two years ago.</p></div>
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="badge hot">Tennis</span><span class="badge">Gaming</span>
        <span class="badge">Books</span><span class="badge">Movies</span><span class="badge">Code</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" id="p-home">
      <h2>⌂ Home</h2>
      <p style="color:#c9d8ef; margin-top:10px; line-height:1.7;">
        Welcome to my corner of the internet. This portfolio is my first real page —
        hand-coded HTML &amp; CSS with a full-throttle energy theme.
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://genshin.hoyoverse.com/en/" target="_blank">My Favourite Site: Genshin Impact →</a>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" id="p-gallery">
      <h2>▤ Gallery</h2>
      <p style="color:#c9d8ef; margin-top:14px; line-height:1.7;">
       <strong><img src="me.png" alt="This is me" style="width:100%;border-radius:14px;margin-top:14px;"&gt;>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" id="p-updates">
      <h2>↻ Updates</h2>
      <div class="fact"><div class="num">✓</div><p>Portfolio v1.0 launched — Red Bull theme.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="num">→</div><p>Next: adding a projects section &amp; dark mode toggle.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="num">★</div><p>Goal: help making a better tomorrow.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" id="p-others">
      <h2>+ Others</h2>
      <p style="color:#c9d8ef; margin-top:10px; line-height:1.7;">
        This portfolio was built in a single HTML file with embedded CSS. The design is inspired by Red Bull's energy and speed, with a focus on bold typography and vibrant colors.
        <code style="color:var(--yellow)">width</code> and <code style="color:var(--yellow)">height</code>
        and the layout is responsive to different screen sizes. The navigation bar at the bottom allows for easy switching between sections.
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<nav>
  <button class="nav" data-target="p-home">home</button>
  <button class="nav" data-target="p-gallery">gallery</button>
  <button class="nav active" data-target="p-post">post</button>
  <button class="nav" data-target="p-updates">updates</button>
  <button class="nav" data-target="p-others">others</button>
</nav>

<script>
  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.nav');
  tabs.forEach(btn => btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    tabs.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
    btn.classList.add('active');
    document.querySelectorAll('.panel').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));
    document.getElementById(btn.dataset.target).classList.add('active');
  }));
</script>

</body>
</html>
